From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: patrickjquinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:00:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/18] dt-bindings: watchdog: mediatek,mtk-wdt: Add MT6858

The MT6858 TOPRGU at 0x1c00a000 is compatible with the MT6589 watchdog,
which is how the stock device tree describes it. Add it to the list that
falls back to mediatek,mt6589-wdt.

Signed-off-by: patrickjquinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/watchdog/mediatek,mtk-wdt.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/watchdog/mediatek,mtk-wdt.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/watchdog/mediatek,mtk-wdt.yaml
index f9b725592..7d8a9d3d1 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/watchdog/mediatek,mtk-wdt.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/watchdog/mediatek,mtk-wdt.yaml
@@ -38,6 +38,7 @@ properties:
               - mediatek,mt6572-wdt
               - mediatek,mt6582-wdt
               - mediatek,mt6797-wdt
+              - mediatek,mt6858-wdt
               - mediatek,mt7622-wdt
               - mediatek,mt7623-wdt
               - mediatek,mt7629-wdt
